WEBVTT

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:18.870
I extend a warm welcome to you on behalf of Nogizaka Gentou, the family head.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.240
How kind of you.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:25.390
Thanks to the upcoming wedding of the Nogizaka family's eldest daughter

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.450
and my family's second eldest son,

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.220
I, as the <i>next</i> family head, humbly accept your hospitality.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.570
<i>In the end, I'm assured of victory.</i>

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.220
<i>I, Tennouji Setsugetsuka!</i>

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:59.050
Yuuto-san... Yuuto-san...

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.460
Nogizaka Haruka,

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:20.240
by standing in my way, you've brought this upon yourself.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:24.560
Your future, your hopes, I'll take it all away from you.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:41.830
Chu! Chu! It's going to be a secret!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.460
Love is a question mark

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:46.130
Love is a question mark

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:46.870
Love is a question mark

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:47.800
Picking what to wear, deciding what looks good on you

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:53.100
Picking what to wear, deciding what looks good on you

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.490
Will I ever get to meet up someday?

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:58.160
Will I ever get to meet up someday?

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:03.060
With you, with you, in that place that remains a secret

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.420
As I tell you my usual

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:09.280
"See you again,"

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:14.990
I get distracted for a second thinking about being with you

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:15.980
Absolutely! Absolutely! I won't lose you!

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.070
Absolutely! Absolutely! I won't lose you!

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:18.740
Absolutely! Absolutely! I won't let go of your hand!

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.680
Absolutely! Absolutely! I won't let go of your hand!

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:23.660
No matter how it comes true,

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.490
it's okay, my dear prince

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.440
From the start, just tell me if you like me

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.370
From the start, just tell me if you like me

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.030
From the start, just tell me if you like me

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:37.700
Girls at that moment like to be loved

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:43.020
From the start, just show me if you like me

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.770
Our romantic silhouette sparkles

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.440
as the golden signs pile up

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.100
as the golden signs pile up

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:50.510
as the golden signs pile up

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:54.580
From then on it'll be a secret with a happy ending

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.990
An essential and endless secret!

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:03.490
It's a secret, between us

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.000
Okay, let's do this

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.540
Onii-san, I know where my sister's—

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:12.790
Huh?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.260
We're very sorry for being late.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:15.790
Hmm?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.480
Mika-chan told me all about it.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.880
How could this happen to Nogizaka-san?

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:20.590
Huh?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.590
We should mount a rescue without delay!

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.850
H-Hold on!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:28.470
What's with you?

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.640
You're sleeping while Onee-chan's in trouble?

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.720
How horrible!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:36.190
Did I really once love this pitiful person?

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.730
I also had feelings for Onii-san,

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.930
but I gave them up for Onee-chan's sake.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:41.950
He's unconscious.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:42.540
Huh?

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:43.410
Unconscious?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.540
Yes.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:48.390
Really now,

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.990
rushing in to see me like that.

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:51.640
You could have at least knocked!

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:54.050
Sorry...

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.090
You're going, right?

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:06.100
I... I haven't heard from Haruka about this.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.010
I'm going to find out what her feelings are.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.440
We've been waiting for you, Yuuto-sama!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.160
All of us have decided to help out.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:22.400
The entire Nogizaka Family Maid Squad is assembled.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.270
This is all due to Yuuto-sama's kindness.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:33.430
We've always wanted to tell you we like you a lot, Yuuto-sama.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.830
Let's go, Yuuto-sama!

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.250
Th-Thank you.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.220
That boosts my confidence.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.500
Okay then!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:45.950
Let's head out!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:50.220
To the final battle destination: Happy Spring Island!

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.560
So,

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.520
why are all of you here?

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.780
Mika-chan said it was okay for us to tag along.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.580
Also, we'll do everything we can to help.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.660
After all, Haruka's a good friend of ours.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.870
Definitely, please let us help you.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:15.000
We're not skipping out while you guys rush to rescue Nogizaka-san!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.430
This is our last chance.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:18.420
We're coming, Haruka-sama!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.340
I'll go anywhere if it's for Yuuto.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.300
Everyone...

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.710
That's right!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:30.210
I'm coming along with Yuu-kun no matter what happens, too.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.660
Hey, Yuuto,

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.770
come have a drink with us!

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.970
Those two are really strange.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.690
Geez, Setsugetsuka

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.650
just never learns.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:47.070
Putting that aside, isn't this a good opportunity for you?

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.280
W-What are you talking about?

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.280
Please don't be coy, my lady.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.330
Is this boy not Rodriguez-dono?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.450
<b>DOG
Is this boy not Rodriguez-dono?</b>

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.410
H-How should I know?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:58.170
His name sounds like some frill-necked lizard.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.170
It's okay though.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.240
Anyway, Koinugawa, hurry and get things ready.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.420
Yes, as you command.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.800
Infiltration's going perfectly.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.820
It all starts here Onii-san.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:23.900
Yeah.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.720
Haruka...

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.290
Yuuto-san?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:45.710
Yuuto-sama, Haruka-sama's located in the Nibelungen Chapel.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.940
Whatever happens to us, Yuuto-sama, you must continue on,

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.630
stopping for nothing!

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.720
I understand.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.640
Here comes the Hellhounds.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.370
We'll hold them off here.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:07.430
Yuuto-sama, please go ahead.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.430
Hurry!

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:12.050
Iwai-san, Mio-san, Koayu-san!

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:28.800
Yuuto-sama!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.510
Leave this to us!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.610
We're not letting you take another step!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.070
Yuuto-sama, go, go!

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.970
Ayame-san, Sara-san...

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.650
Haruka-sama's waiting for you!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.020
Juri-san.

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.040
Whoa!

00:07:57.480 --> 00:07:58.170
Let's go!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.540
Okay!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.250
Leave these guys to us.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.060
Hey! Are you serious?

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:09.540
We've always wanted to do something besides just fool around.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:12.190
You gotta let us show it here at the end.

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:16.180
What they said. Now, hurry up, Yuuto!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:21.720
Nagai, Ogawa, Takenami, Nobunaga.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.140
I'm sorry!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:29.850
I won't let your sacrifice be in vain!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.110
Don't kill us off that quickly!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.760
Minamo-san, Maria-san!

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.990
The Hellhounds are about to catch up, so we'll hold them off.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:45.850
Yuuto-sama,

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.960
please continue on like we discussed earlier.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:58.040
Yuuto-sama's really willing to give his all for her, he's a splendid person.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.170
When it's work, personal feelings are taboo.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.670
But just this once,

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:05.390
we'll fight for your sake, Yuuto-sama.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.430
Time to go!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:17.030
Yuuto, we're gonna go all out.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.530
Go on and be a man!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:20.870
Yeah!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.790
Good kids shouldn't try this.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.500
You're not getting past!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.700
Come at me with anything you got.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.600
Ruri Dokoro's just aching for a taste of new victims.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:45.050
And I've decided I'll be the one to make Yuu-kun into a <i>real</i> man!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.140
Shiina, Sawamura, Asahina-san!

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:59.120
We're fine, so go on ahead.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:09:59.820
But...

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.500
It's fine, it's fine.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.540
Even if we're locked up for life, we won't die.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.290
Hurry and go save Nogizaka-san.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.300
I'm glad that you were my first love.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.510
Make Nogizaka-san happy, 'kay?

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.010
Got it.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.000
Thank you, Yuuto.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.660
I see, I see.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:28.130
Shiina had feelings for Ayase-cchi, didn't she?

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:29.530
U-Umm, that's...

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:30.650
Gotcha!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.320
We've known for a long time now.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:33.000
What?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.070
R-Really?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.530
It was quite obvious.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:45.740
Please stand aside.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.790
Yuuto-san is here, right?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.440
Let me through!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.970
The Nibelungen Chapel is just ahead.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.430
So that's where Haruka is.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:16.330
Leave the fighting to the three of us.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:19.600
Yuuto-sama, Mika-sama, please proceed without delay.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:22.490
Hazuki-san, Nanami-san, Alice.

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.330
Bruder.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.170
I like Yuuto-sama.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.620
That's why I won't let anyone stop you.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.690
I will protect...

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.070
Yuuto-sama!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.120
Thank you for bringing me this far.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.270
I'm going!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.480
Dad.

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:25.010
Haruka... Haruka's past that door, right?

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:26.530
That's right.

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:28.500
Well done getting this far.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.110
You have my praise, Ayase Yuuto.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:31.940
However,

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.800
I cannot let you go any further.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:37.320
Haruka's wedding ceremony begins soon.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.740
I will not let the likes of you interfere.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:44.910
I need to be with Haruka.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:47.370
Please let me through.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.920
To put it simply: "Get lost!"

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.460
You'll not let me through no matter what?

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.790
Too much talk!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.010
In that case,

00:12:58.010 --> 00:12:59.760
I'll have to force my way!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.210
Like I said, I ain't letting you!

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.180
Onii-san!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:09.460
What's wrong with you Dad, why are you hitting him?

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.640
Just shut up!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.100
This is between me and Ayase Yuuto.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.870
Even my daughter has no right to butt in.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:21.980
Come!

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.440
If you wish to get past me,

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:27.280
give me your best shot!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:34.810
If you're really a man, prove your feelings with your fists.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:38.790
Onii-san.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.550
What's wrong, boy?

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.010
Can you really

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:51.470
protect Haruka being like this?

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.430
You really thought you could?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.480
I—

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.810
If you're not strong, then get stronger.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:05.890
Can you really protect a woman of the
Nogizaka family with this level of power?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:10.870
You think this half-assed strength will get me to entrust Haruka to you?

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.830
Stop it already! You're gonna kill Onii-san!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.660
Yuuto-san!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:23.000
Mother?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.670
I wonder where you might be heading off to?

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:29.130
Mother, let me see Yuuto-san!

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.960
And what will you do afterward?

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.600
Your wedding ceremony starts momentarily.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.350
No!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.550
I don't want this marriage.

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:38.560
The one I love is—

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.360
Cease speaking, child.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:50.910
If you wish to see Yuuto-san, you must defeat me first.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.370
But... why?

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.140
As long as you are a daughter of the Nogizaka family,

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:59.490
things such as true love are not meant to be.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.330
Now, let me behold your feelings,

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.220
and your resolve, Haruka!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.300
Mother...

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.200
What's wrong?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.760
Giving up already?

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:12.750
Please!

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.530
Stop this already, Dad!

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:18.730
To get this far and still be so weak...

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.360
How pathetic.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:23.190
This fool comes here and gets all beat up...

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.430
Haruka! You're a disgrace to the Nogizaka family.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:29.330
I'm ashamed of my own daughter!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:32.660
What was that?

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.810
I said she's a disgrace.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.870
A complete and total failure!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.210
Oh? Getting mad now?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.000
But what can you do?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.070
You're weak, short and poor.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:52.150
An existence wallowing in mud!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:56.340
I... understand that better than anyone.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.400
Still...

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.570
Still...

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:04.560
Hearing you speak badly of the person I treasure most,

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.890
is something I will <i>not</i> allow!

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.610
Oh...

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:13.040
That was a nice punch just now.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.860
But it's still not enough!

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:21.940
Even so,

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:25.540
there's no way... I'm backing down.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.650
This display of skill,

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:37.150
is that all your feelings for Yuuto-san amount to?

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:41.840
You dare to defy us to see him and yet this is how insignificant they are?

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:44.580
It's not about seeing him.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:47.240
I only want to be by his side.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:52.650
Always... by... Yuuto-san.

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:54.780
Always!

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:59.530
He's more important than anyone or anything in this world.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:03.110
And that's why... my feelings will <i>never</i> yield!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:10.220
Too soft!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:16.090
Huh, you're not bad when you get serious.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:19.510
But can you beat me with just that?

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:24.390
Same to you. Age getting to you, Gentou-san?

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.480
Your strength's dropping.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.440
You talk funny, boy.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.820
<i>That's strange, those two seem to be</i>

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.200
<i>having fun.</i>

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.670
Ayase Yuuto, tell me,

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:51.040
what is Haruka to you?

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:55.510
Haruka is...

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:02.760
Yuuto-san!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.390
Yuuto-san!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.610
Yuuto-san!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.190
For me, Haruka is...

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.410
<i>EVERYTHING!</i>

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.430
I see.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.870
Then there's nothing left to be said!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.440
Ayase Yuuto,

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:34.340
if those are you true feelings, hit me with all you've got!

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.850
Come, Haruka!

